{'symbol': 'CTSH', 'date': '2022-12-15 08:00:00', 'title': 'SYNITI AND COGNIZANT PARTNER TO DELIVER IMPROVED DATA TRANSFORMATION', 'text': "STRATEGIC ALLIANCE WILL HELP DRIVE JOINT CUSTOMERS' MIGRATIONS TO SAP S/4HANA® BOSTON , DEC. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SYNITI, A GLOBAL LEADER IN ENTERPRISE DATA MANAGEMENT, AND COGNIZANT TODAY ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC ALLIANCE AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE TWO COMPANIES. SYNITI WILL BE COGNIZANT'S SOLUTION PROVIDER OF CHOICE FOR DATA TRANSFORMATION DELIVERY IN DRIVING CUSTOMERS' MIGRATIONS TO SAP S/4HANA®."}